-</div></header><main id="main"><div class="wrap"><p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Announcements archive</p><div class="news-archive vap-news"><div class="archive-hero"><span class="archive-eyebrow">VAP · NEWS ARCHIVE</span><h1>Announcements archive</h1><p>VAP research and website update history.</p></div><aside class="news-status"><p>Experimental extensions remain unadopted; independent third-party reproduction has not been established. First-party CI and saved-evidence checks are distinct from independent fresh execution.</p></aside><p class="archive-history-label">Dates below are original publication dates. Later updates are identified when recorded. Historical notices describe the status at that time; their claims are not new confirmations of adoption, conformance or certification.</p><form class="archive-controls" hidden><label>Month<select name="month"><option value="">All</option><option value="2026-11">2026-11</option><option value="2026-10">2026-10</option></select></label><label class="archive-search">Search announcements<input type="search" name="search" autocomplete="off"></label><input type="hidden" name="category" value=""><button type="reset">Reset filters</button></form><p class="archive-count" id="archive-count" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-template="{shown} of {total} records">15 of 15 records</p><p class="archive-empty" id="archive-empty" hidden>No announcements match these filters.</p><section class="archive-month" id="month-2026-11"><h2>2026-11</h2><ul class="news-list"><li class="news-row" id="registry-release-20261113" data-news-record data-month="2026-11" data-category="research"><div class="news-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-13">2026-11-13</time></div><div><h3><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-13-registry-release-known-issue/">VSO adds ten source reviews and a fixed-demo known-issue notice</a></h3><p class="news-summary">Ten source reviews added; the fixed demo now has a known-issue notice. Signature fix: main only, absent from fixed ZIP. Extensions unadopted; independent reproduction not…</p><details class="archive-record" id="registry-release-20261113-record"><summary>Read the archived notice</summary><p class="archive-history-label">Historical notice, including existing corrections</p><div class="archive-original"><section id="original-registry-release-20261113" class="status"><h2>VSO adds ten source reviews and a fixed-demo known-issue notice</h2><p>Website PR #224 adds ten reviews, bringing the registry to 64 entries: 19 registered and 45 source-verified, pending registration. The ten additions belong to the latter category. They are not ten newly confirmed incidents, and the total does not mean 64 registered cases.</p><p>PR #68 merged the explicit input policy into main. It is absent from the fixed tag, fixed ZIP and original 32-test record. This update changes the public explanation only: the tag, all five assets, checksums and historical execution evidence are retained. No replacement ZIP or new release is announced. Reports must pin the implementation commit.</p><p>Experimental extensions remain unadopted; independent third-party reproduction has not been established. Source checks, synthetic observations and CI described here are first-party work. Merging or passing CI does not establish full normative conformance, adoption, certification or production suitability.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-13-registry-release-known-issue/">Read updates, pinned revisions and limits</a> · <a href="https://github.com/veritaschain/vap-spec/releases/tag/vap-interop-demo-v0.2.0">GitHub release</a></p></section></div></details></div></li><li class="news-row" id="signature-source-20261112" data-news-record data-month="2026-11" data-category="research"><div class="news-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-12">2026-11-12</time></div><div><h3><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-12-vap-signature-source-update/">VSO updates VAP references and research status; signature fix is on main only</a></h3><p class="news-summary">13 Nov: site CI at 720852c passed 110 image comparisons. Signature fix: main only, absent from fixed ZIP. Extensions unadopted; independent reproduction not established.</p><details class="archive-record" id="signature-source-20261112-record"><summary>Read the archived notice</summary><p class="archive-history-label">Historical notice, including existing corrections</p><div class="archive-original"><section id="original-signature-source-20261112" class="status"><h2>VSO updates VAP references and research status; signature fix is on main only</h2><p>VAP PR #68 strengthens Ed25519 input rejection in the experimental Python/Node interop demo. The fix is merged into main (35e56ba; included in e00ee5a). It is NOT included in the fixed vap-interop-demo-v0.2.0 ZIP, which remains at cbd4502. No replacement ZIP or new release is announced. Experimental extensions remain unadopted; independent third-party reproduction has not been established.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-12-vap-signature-source-update/">Read source revisions, the main/ZIP distinction and limitations</a></p><div id="original-main-ci-20261113"><h3>13 November follow-up: 110 image comparisons passed in site main CI</h3><p>Website vcp-site fix merge <code>720852c</code> completed all six workflows and 13 jobs. All 110 image comparisons passed with zero failures and zero raster-noise allowances. Incorrect-CSS rejection and animation checks also passed; comparison criteria were not relaxed. These are first-party CI results for this fixed website revision.</p><p>Experimental extensions remain unadopted; independent third-party reproduction is not established. This is not a new research-implementation test or independent reproduction. Earlier failures, historical test records and the distinction between fixed distributions and main are retained.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-12-vap-signature-source-update/#main-ci-20261113">Read the first-party CI revision, results and limits</a> · <a href="https://github.com/veritaschain/vcp-site/actions/runs/43330507404">CI · 720852c</a></p></div></section></div></details></div></li><li class="news-row" id="cloud-evidence-20261108" data-news-record data-month="2026-11" data-category="research"><div class="news-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-08">2026-11-08</time></div><div><h3><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-08-cloud-evidence-maintenance-update/">VSO reports ten merged cloud-evidence and maintenance updates</a></h3><p class="news-summary">Ten merged PRs cover cloud-evidence research, interop release preparation and maintenance. The demo was unpublished at the initial review; a later experimental prerelease is…</p><details class="archive-record" id="cloud-evidence-20261108-record"><summary>Read the archived notice</summary><p class="archive-history-label">Historical notice, including existing corrections</p><div class="archive-original"><section id="original-cloud-evidence-20261108" class="status"><h2>VSO reports ten merged cloud-evidence and maintenance updates</h2><p>Ten merged PRs cover cloud-evidence research, interop release preparation, Explorer dependency maintenance, local-settings guards and incident-source records. PR #61 is release preparation and was unpublished at the initial review. A later experimental prerelease at 12:09 JST on 8 November is recorded separately in the linked article. The research is unadopted; independent reproduction is not established. Test and CI records are first-party checks, not independent confirmation.</p><p>All cloud experiments are synthetic and operated by the same party; no live cloud calls were made. They do not prove Azure origin, complete observation, independent custody, latestness, third-party timestamps, power-loss durability or production readiness. A valid older snapshot can remain valid without